&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Development of consumption analysis modules, comparative queries between periods, segmentation of information by installation and device, calculation of energy indicators, identification of consumption trends, generation of analytical reports and support tools for energy efficiency studies.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Functional requirements analysis, design of information models, frontend and backend component development, optimization of analytical queries, implementation of energy calculations, functional validation with specialized users and continuous improvement of the platform's analytical capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
ASP.NET MVC, C#, SQL, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Git and technologies focused on enterprise applications for monitoring, data analysis and energy management.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution significantly improved the analysis capability of the available energy information, made it easier to detect anomalous consumption, supported energy optimization studies and provided more advanced tools for the efficient management of installations and energy resources.&lt;/p&gt;

